+# v1.3 validation record
+
+This record describes the checks performed on the `symthaea-statistics` v1.3
+release candidate in the artifact environment.
+
+## Source surface
+
+- 128 public modules plus one private model-matrix module
+- 663 resolved root exports
+- 130 Rust source files and 26 integration-test files
+- 522 `#[test]` functions present in source and integration tests
+- no `unsafe` token outside the crate-level prohibition
+- no production `unwrap`, `expect`, `panic!`, or `unreachable!` surface
+- complete module/file declaration parity
+- every stable-v1 prelude item resolves through the root export surface
+- `API_LEVEL = 1` and `NUMERICAL_CONTRACT = "validated-v1"` remain unchanged
+
+## Syntax and repository checks
+
+- all 156 Rust source and integration-test files parse without tree-sitter error nodes
+- `git diff --check` passes
+- the independent v1.3 generator reproduces its committed JSON byte-for-byte
+- stable-v1 compatibility tests validate the major API generation rather than pinning a past minor version
+
+## Independent numerical landmarks
+
+The retained generator uses NumPy, SciPy, scikit-learn, and statsmodels/direct
+matrix formulas to record independent values for:
+
+- pooled-covariance discriminant probabilities
+- canonical correlations
+- Wilks' lambda and Pillai's trace
+- precision-matrix partial correlations
+- Gaussian-copula latent correlation and log density
+- left-censored Gaussian Tobit coefficients, scale, and likelihood
+- linear mediation paths and indirect effects
+- separated-cluster k-means centroids and inertia
+- MASE/RMSSE/sMAPE forecast accuracy
+- perfect-ranking concordance and perfect-prediction Brier scores
+
+Rust integration vectors bind these values with explicit tolerances. Seeded
+permutation, bootstrap, copula-sampling, and k-means paths also carry
+reproducibility tests.
+
+## Contract hardening
+
+The v1.3 layer rejects malformed class tables, under-replicated QDA classes,
+singular canonical covariance blocks, one-group MANOVA inputs, invalid copula
+shrinkage, closed-cube copula density points, all-censored Tobit samples,
+uncensored observations on the wrong side of a boundary, mediation length
+mismatches, impossible cluster counts, degenerate scaled-forecast baselines,
+non-positive Diebold-Mariano long-run variance, survival probabilities outside
+`[0,1]`, increasing survival curves, and survival comparisons without comparable
+event pairs.
+
+Quadratic pairwise work in silhouette and concordance calculations and repeated
+MANOVA/mediation resampling work are bounded explicitly.
+
+## Unavailable checks
+
+The artifact environment contains no installed Rust toolchain. Therefore Cargo
+compilation, execution of the 522 Rust tests, Clippy, rustfmt, rustdoc, and
+`cargo package` were not performed here. `scripts/verify.sh` remains the
+authoritative Rust 1.85+ lane; `scripts/verify_v1_3_references.sh` is the
+separate scientific-Python reference-regeneration lane.
